      "comment": "FOX DAN (9) has been kept fresh since coming from this row to take out the Vicbred 4EG Super Series Final by 4 metres at Melton last start. Accomplished pacer who has won five of six tries at this distance. With even luck he can add another. His stablemate STORMS COLLIDE (7) was fourth to FOX DAN in the Vicbred final last start, adding to his consistent form. He too owns a good record at this distance and should be able to push forward from this barrier. That could see him tough to catch. CALEXICO (8) is in contention after coming from this row to score by 1.2 metres at this circuit and distance last time out. PAS GUARANTEE (4) is a first four hope after a respectable second at his most recent appearance at Melton.",
